# ⚠ MUHAMMAD'S OWN DEMO SEEDER, IGNORED SO IT CANNOT BE SWEPT IN AGAIN — Task 12.
#
# `git add -A apps/api` committed this file at `c0aa76f`. It is his untracked scratch script
# (a hand-written restaurant seeder with Arabic commentary, paired with
# `docs/PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION_AR.md`), it was never part of any ticket, and it has been
# rewritten out of this branch's history. His ruling: *"add its path to `.gitignore` so it
# cannot recur, and revert pint's reformatting of it. And never `git add -A` in this repo
# again — stage paths you name."*
#
# ⚠ AND IGNORING IT HERE IS NOT ENOUGH TO KEEP `composer pint` OFF IT — MEASURED, after the
# first version of this comment claimed the opposite. `vendor/bin/pint` does NOT honour
# `.gitignore`: with this entry in place it still reported
# `{"path":"seed_restaurant.php","fixers":[...]}` and exited 1. That matters because it is the
# second half of the problem this file caused — an unformatted untracked file at `apps/api`
# root made `composer pint` RED before any of Task 12's work, and formatting it was the only
# way to obtain a gate run at all.
#
# So the pint half lives in `pint.json`'s `notPath`, and `PintScopeTest` holds that exclusion
# to exactly this one path with the preset pinned, so it cannot quietly grow into excluding
# `app/`.
/seed_restaurant.php
